id=wa_sd_media
name=WhatsApp SD Media
version=v2.2-android16
versionCode=3
author=guysoft
description=Offloads an app's Android/media folder to an ext4 partition on SD card. v1 stacked sdcardfs (Android <=12). v2 enters MediaProvider's mount namespace with nsenter for pure-FUSE Android 13+, event-driven rebind on provider restart, self-healing GPT repair.
